---
// src/components/StudentPackPerks.astro
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-brand-500/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900/90 via-brand-950/30 to-slate-900/90 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden shadow-glow">
      <!-- Glow decoration -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-950 border border-brand-500/30 text-brand-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Infraestructura de Nivel Empresarial
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Tecnología de primer nivel respaldada por los mejores aliados
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Al trabajar conmigo, tu proyecto cuenta con soporte de herramientas de clase mundial integradas de forma nativa para garantizar seguridad, cobros fiables y entregabilidad absoluta.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Stripe Feature -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-700/50 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 font-bold mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Stripe Payment Gateway</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Cobro seguro con tarjetas de crédito, débito y Google/Apple Pay. Integración optimizada sin tarifas ocultas y con máxima protección anti-fraude para tu negocio.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>0% comisiones extra de desarrollo</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testmail.app Feature -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-950/80 border border-sky-700/50 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400 font-bold mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Testmail & Deliverability</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Entorno automatizado para probar correos transaccionales y notificaciones de clientes. Cero riesgo de que tus cotizaciones o consultas caigan en la carpeta de spam.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Notificaciones 100% testeadas</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Edge CDN & Security -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-700/50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Namecheap SSL & Edge CDN</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Tu sitio vive en servidores globales de alta velocidad con certificado SSL automático (candado verde de seguridad) y 99.9% de uptime garantizado sin caídas de servidor.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Hosting global con costo $0 de servidor</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
